      {
        "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.CfgDialogGroup, Assembly-CSharp",
        "desc": null,
        "textMaxIndex": 0,
        "textGroupId": "10000007008_2",
        "useFixedDialogGroup": false,
        "fixedDialogGroupId": 0,
        "dialogs": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp]], mscorlib",
          "$values": [
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119344_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "你要听听，我的想法，对啵？\n那占用你，一点时间。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119344_content",
                "value": "你要听听，我的想法，对啵？\n那占用你，一点时间。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1870119344
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119345_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "以前，很久、很久以前，\n我不在陆地生活。\n那时候，也没有“家”。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119345_content",
                "value": "以前，很久、很久以前，\n我不在陆地生活。\n那时候，也没有“家”。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1870119345
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119346_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "啵！\n我的意思是，不像现在，\n那时候，整片海洋、都是家。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119346_content",
                "value": "啵！\n我的意思是，不像现在，\n那时候，整片海洋、都是家。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1870119346
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119347_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "洋流，从家里穿过，\n一睁眼，已经、在另一个角落。\n<style=SizeSmall>在陆地上，风也一样。</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119347_content",
                "value": "洋流，从家里穿过，\n一睁眼，已经、在另一个角落。\n<style=SizeSmall>在陆地上，风也一样。</style>",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1870119347
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119348_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A笑眯眯}所以，我很喜欢“家”。\n一个固定的、只属于我的地方。\n没有风，也没有洋流。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119348_content",
                "value": "{A笑眯眯}所以，我很喜欢“家”。\n一个固定的、只属于我的地方。\n没有风，也没有洋流。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1870119348
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119349_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "不用担心，曲谱四散，\n也不用担心，突然、和朋友们分开。\n<style=SizeSmall>或许，也给朋友们一个家？</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119349_content",
                "value": "不用担心，曲谱四散，\n也不用担心，突然、和朋友们分开。\n<style=SizeSmall>或许，也给朋友们一个家？</style>",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1870119349
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119350_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A想象}虽然、在陆地上，\n但像大海一样，\n湿润、透明、亮晶晶。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119350_content",
                "value": "{A想象}虽然、在陆地上，\n但像大海一样，\n湿润、透明、亮晶晶。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1870119350
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119351_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "待在里面，\n听着水流的旋律，\n身体慢慢沉下去，心却轻飘飘……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119351_content",
                "value": "待在里面，\n听着水流的旋律，\n身体慢慢沉下去，心却轻飘飘……",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1870119351
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119352_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "如同置身海底、又能安心谱曲的地方。\n{A纳蕾娜跳跳}这就是、我对“家”的想法~。\n这些想法，我写在了、<style=Highlight>设计单</style>上。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010157008_1870119352_content",
                "value": "如同置身海底、又能安心谱曲的地方。\n{A纳蕾娜跳跳}这就是、我对“家”的想法~。\n这些想法，我写在了、<style=Highlight>设计单</style>上。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
